WEBVTT

00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:18,080
My oncologist said that I shouldn't take immune stimulator supplements when doing chemotherapy.

00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:26,320
Is this true? No, that's not true. The only thing that you shouldn't do when you're as far

00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:32,560
as supplement wise, when you're doing chemotherapy, and I would say that you shouldn't do it,

00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:38,320
even if you're not doing chemotherapy, it shouldn't take antioxidants because chemotherapy is an

00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:44,640
oxidizing agent. That's how it kills cancer. If you're taking antioxidants while you're doing

00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:51,600
chemotherapy, you're kind of negating the benefit of the chemotherapy. And you heard me say a

00:00:51,600 --> 00:01:00,320
million times that even if you're not doing chemotherapy, most alternative cancer therapies are oxidative.

00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:07,680
And if you are taking antioxidants while you're taking those, you're negating the effects of

00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:19,600
those possibly. Most therapies to kill cancer are going to be oxidative in nature, not all, but most.

00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:27,360
And all therapies to kill cancer need to have an element of immune stimulation.

00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:35,280
So if you were taking immune stimulators while taking chemotherapy, while doing chemotherapy,

00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:43,040
you would only help the chemotherapy work better. So immune stimulators are not going to

00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:55,280
counteract any alternative or standard of care therapy. So many times oncologists will just take this

00:01:55,280 --> 00:02:01,920
approach that, okay, you're doing chemotherapy, don't do anything else. You shouldn't do anything

00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:06,080
else. I've never heard an oncologist say you shouldn't take an immune stimulator supplements,

00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:10,480
although you're doing chemotherapy, that's obvious that oncologist probably

00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:20,720
doesn't even know what that means. So I would say that you would just ignore that.

00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:29,440
But it's certainly, I think everybody that's trying to treat cancer naturally should, or even

00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:33,440
standard of care should be doing lots of things that will stimulate their immune system. It's only

00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:44,160
to help everything work better.

